{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0fSpectator has returned!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Spectator 3</strong>\u2014the next chapter in the anomaly-spotting psychological horror series. It's a brand-new descent into paranoia. <strong>Spectator 3</strong> amplifies everything \u2014 the fear, the mystery, the horror.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>What You See Can Hurt You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Spectator. Behind a wall of flickering screens, you must detect the undetectable \u2014 things that <i>shouldn\u2019t</i> be. A painting changed. A figure moved. A whisper that leaves no echo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss one\u2026 and it spreads.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>New Features Include:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A NEW LEVEL OF DREAD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security feeds from even more twisted environments. The anomalies are smarter, bolder\u2014and now, some of them <strong>know you're watching</strong>. Your perception is your last line of defense. Use it wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DYNAMIC ANOMALY SYSTEM<br><strong>No two playthroughs are alike.</strong> Every session is procedurally haunted with layers of randomized, reactive phenomena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEEPER HORROR, DARKER LORE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expanded narrative weaves throughout every camera feed. Cryptic messages, recurring figures, and overlapping timelines hint at a hidden truth. Can you piece it together before everything breaks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator 3\u00a0</strong>isn't just about spotting what's wrong.<br>It's about questioning what\u2019s right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3769380?t=1763507075","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3769380?t=1763507075","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769380/04c983a7c8ef75a4acadaf142afc689989cea384/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763507075","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769380/04c983a7c8ef75a4acadaf142afc689989cea384/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763507075","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Figures of Ghosts, Monsters, Dead bodies.  \r\nSigns of violence, Blood Stains, Body parts. "},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0fSpectator has returned!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Spectator 3</strong>\u2014the next chapter in the anomaly-spotting psychological horror series. It's a brand-new descent into paranoia. <strong>Spectator 3</strong> amplifies everything \u2014 the fear, the mystery, the horror.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>What You See Can Hurt You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Spectator. Behind a wall of flickering screens, you must detect the undetectable \u2014 things that <i>shouldn\u2019t</i> be. A painting changed. A figure moved. A whisper that leaves no echo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss one\u2026 and it spreads.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>New Features Include:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A NEW LEVEL OF DREAD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security feeds from even more twisted environments. The anomalies are smarter, bolder\u2014and now, some of them <strong>know you're watching</strong>. Your perception is your last line of defense. Use it wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DYNAMIC ANOMALY SYSTEM<br><strong>No two playthroughs are alike.</strong> Every session is procedurally haunted with layers of randomized, reactive phenomena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEEPER HORROR, DARKER LORE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expanded narrative weaves throughout every camera feed. Cryptic messages, recurring figures, and overlapping timelines hint at a hidden truth. Can you piece it together before everything breaks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator 3\u00a0</strong>isn't just about spotting what's wrong.<br>It's about questioning what\u2019s right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Neko Machine"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769380/1f970c40cb1b7fb8f8ebceff9e5582bd8a446adf/header.jpg?t=1763507075","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Neko Machine - All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3769380/1527780720/50ef1fc3149f441239677944fe64526000189bda/1750380526/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749805133","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3769380/1527780720/50ef1fc3149f441239677944fe64526000189bda/1750380526/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749805133","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3769380/1527780720/50ef1fc3149f441239677944fe64526000189bda/1750380526/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749805133","id":257156315,"name":"Trailer demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257156315/4db06af01602990a2b5ea0c13ccade837da684f1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749805133"}],"na